A||||32||Zoom88||Ok here are the Pics of the New Side Scoops !!!||||1||
Z||000000||Zoom88||11-30-2001||06:02 PM||||Ok here are the pics of my car.<BR>The tires I run on the front are Dunlop Sport A2 215/60 15 and on the rear are Dunlop sport 8000 245/50 15. By the way I painted the scoops myself using spray paint I purchased from paintscratch.com it isn't cheap but it works great (see for yourself), Sprayed 5 coats white clearcoat and 5 coats of clearcoat.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Zoom88a.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Zoom88d.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Zoom88e.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Zoom88f.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Zoom88g.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Zoom88i.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Zoom88j.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||1
