Z||000002||Zoom88||11-30-2001||07:44 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pyric:<BR><B>Sweet... that's one of the sets I'm looking at.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I would recommend them to anyone, I didn't have to do any modifications to them whatsoever they bolted right up. If you are going to get some somewhere else be careful, I looked at alot of them some require a lot of work while others the quality was poor!<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse/fullpanel.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse/fullpanel.html</A> <P>||||reg||1
