Z||000006||Zoom88||11-30-2001||11:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by jelly2m8:<BR><B>I'm not a fan of side scoops, but DAMN thats a sweet car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P> Very nice zomm88<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> Thank You I love working on it....almost like an addiction  (but one of the good kind !!!!)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Zoom88||11-30-2001||11:24 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by avengador1:<BR><B>OK, I checked them out. Really nice! I didn't notice, but did you put screens in them or just left them open?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>  I purchased them with the screens attached, you can get them with or without. They came galvanized, they can be removed but you must remove the scoops from the car to remove them. So I removed them before installing the scoops, beadblasted them lightly to help the paint stick (we are talking about the screens !!) Sprayed them with a primer, then several coats of clearcoat black and finished with several coats of clear.<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000008||Zoom88||11-30-2001||11:33 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierohoho:<BR><B>Zoom88 those are sweet, I checked the site but it must be down, could you post some other info on who sells them.<P>Awesome car too.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Here is the link once again, I tried it and had no problems. It is worth checking out they offer several other items for sale also !!<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse/parts.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse/parts.html</A> <P>But just in case here is more info.<BR>Contact the Fiero Warehouse: dmkfiero@ovis.net<BR>or, use this email if the above fails dmkfiero@hotmail.com<P>PS He is also a member of the forum and goes by the name SAGE.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><p>[This message has been edited by Zoom88 (edited 11-30-2001).]||||reg||6
